{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bear","model_identifier":"bear","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bear\n\nBear (B7), 1.3 m at the shoulder hump (46 u), 2.6 m standing (rear_roar reaches about 90 u), about 2.3 m long (64 u body + head).\n\nBig brown bear of the giant forests: heavy barrel body, shoulder hump, short thick neck, broad head with small dark eyes and round ears, separate lower jaw for roar/bite, stubby tail, thick plantigrade legs with heavy paws and pale claws. Quadruped rig: root > body > neck > head > jaw, body > tail_1, four legs (upper, lower, foot).\n\n- Cubes: 22 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.0..11.0, y 0.0..45.5, z -42.0..25.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 20 x 46 x 64 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n- rearing: 20 x 92 x 30 around the hind feet\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop | breathing, looking around |\n| `walk` | 0.9 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.45 | loop |  |\n| `charge` | 0.414 | loop |  |\n| `swipe` | 1 | once | key 0.46 s: right forepaw sweeps through the target (arc in front, right to left) |\n| `rear_roar` | 2.6 | once | stands up (1.0 s fully upright), roar key 1.0-1.6 s, drops back by 2.6 s |\n| `sniff` | 2.4 | loop | nose to the ground, swinging side to side (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back from the front |\n| `death` | 1.4 | hold | buckles and rolls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `mate` | 2.0 | loop | Patch 5: a gentle nuzzle toward the partner on the model's left (head and neck turn, body sway, tail wag; birds fluff their wings, the hare hops), played by two animals side by side while the game draws hearts over them. |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 0.9 s (4-beat)\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.00 m/s), cycle 0.45 s (bounding gallop)\n- `charge`: 204.4 u/s (5.75 m/s), head low\n\n## Key times\n\n- `swipe`: key 0.46 s: right forepaw sweeps through the target (arc in front, right to left)\n- `rear_roar`: stands up (1.0 s fully upright), roar key 1.0-1.6 s, drops back by 2.6 s\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `bear_cub.png`: young texture (use at half scale): lighter, fluffier, bigger-looking eyes\n\n## Notes\n\n- Legs are straight under the hips at rest; gait clips use IK so the paws stay planted at the designed speed."},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"torso","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.5,21,-18],"to":[10.5,39.5,13],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,34,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[31,51,52,69.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[78,31,109,49.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[52,51,73,69.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,51,31,69.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,21,31],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[21,0,42,31],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d39f6cef-00c8-5088-9143-9a56216737c4"},{"name":"rump","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10,22,11],"to":[10,38.5,22],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,34,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[73,51,93,67.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[113,51,124,67.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[93,51,113,67.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,70,11,86.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[51,87,71,98],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[71,87,91,98],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c2daa469-f5f4-58a7-b460-72849a3adb8f"},{"name":"hump","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-9,37,-17],"to":[9,45.5,-3],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,